OL,3,ALib Dem leader Ed Davey to warn of AI's
OL,4,A'existential threat' in conference
OL,5,Aspeech
OL,6,
OL,7,FLiberal Democrat leader Ed Davey will
OL,8,Fdeliver a speech later at his party's
OL,9,Fautumn conference in Brighton - watch
OL,10,Flive from about 14:30 BST
OL,12,FHe's expected to set out policies and
OL,13,Fspeak about the global development of
OL,14,FAI, and its "existential threat"
OL,16,FIn the run-up to his address, Davey
OL,17,Fsays there is no ceiling on Lib Dem
OL,18,Fambitions and that he's a "candidate to
OL,19,Fbe prime minister"
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
